  m_Name: WednesdayIntro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSO
  dialogueType: 0
  sentences:
  - Greetings.
  - I have arrived to drop off my Lubert. He is quite the special one!
  - My Lubert knows how to talk and is extremely smart. Do not be surprised if he 
    speaks better than you! Ha~ ha~.
  - Anyways, I must get going now. I will be back in the evening to get my Lubert
    back.
  - Toodaloo~
